<title>CANADA: Hudson's Bay chief executive to retire.</title>
<headline>Hudson's Bay chief executive to retire.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hudson's Bay Co, Canada's largest department store chain, said on Thursday that President and Chief Executive George Kosich would retire on August 3.</p>
<p>The board of directors has appointed a succession committee, Canada's oldest retailer said.</p>
<p>&quot;The long-term strategy and the new organizational structure for the corporation is fundamentally in place and will ensure continued improved results in the future,&quot; Hudson's Bay said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8109))</p>
</text>
